<p>Last updated: July 2026</p>
<p>AIRComms is a private scheduling notification tool used solely to communicate cleaning schedules between the property owner and their cleaner.</p>
<h2>Data Collected</h2>
<p>We collect booking dates, property names, and phone numbers solely for the purpose of sending scheduling notifications.</p>
<h2>Data Sharing</h2>
<p>No data is shared with third parties. Phone numbers are used only via Twilio for SMS delivery.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Contact the property owner directly with any questions.</p>

<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
<p>AIRComms sends automated scheduling notifications for property cleaning services. Messages are informational only. Reply STOP to opt out.</p>
